  Copyright (c) 2021-2026 Jakob Ketterl, Marat Fayzullin and contributors;
  Copyright (c) 2014-2015 Andras Retzler, HA7ILM.

owrx_connector 0.6.5 (https://github.com/luarvique/owrx_connector, tag 0.6.5)
