Combined work
-------------

The meshsdr binary is a combined work of AGPL-3.0-or-later code with
GPL-3.0-or-later and BSD-licensed parts of libcsdr++, FFTW
(GPL-2.0-or-later) and libsamplerate (BSD-2-Clause). GPLv3 section 13 and
AGPLv3 section 13 allow this combination (ADR 0014).
